BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wolf Cave Creatures\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T100000
UID:373b5fccf1c55115cdb70a4eea956a6b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Presentation) You will learn how caves are a unique place to 
 live. We will explore how food webs work inside a cave system and how each
  animal has specialized adaptions to survive where sunlight doesn&rsquo\;t
  exist. This program is being held in the Nature Center Auditorium.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Little Wolf Cave\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T150000
UID:92e57364fecce45e81a189239bed4ab4@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Outdoor Skills) This is a kid friendly event to learn about s
 urvival skills you will need when caving. We will talk about how to proper
 ly prepare yourself for your first caving adventure. Be ready to tie knots
  and to crawl. Drop by the Nature Center anytime between 1-3 pm to explore
 .
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:True Flying Mammals\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260626T223000
UID:4606e90236ca3bec973226ac710d6038@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) Join the park naturalist to learn about the one and onl
 y true flying mammals on this night hike. EEK\, while bats seem spooky\, t
 hey have a great ecological importance. Join us at Deer Run Shelter to hik
 e trail 9. Bring or borrow a red flashlight from us. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Deer Run Shelter\, 250 McCormick's
  Creek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paint a Painted Turtle\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260627T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260627T140000
UID:8ece48c5add3215c1836cca204b86339@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Craft) Join Naturalist Kaitlyn at the Nature Center to paint 
 a still life of our native Painted Turtle. This painting class will allow 
 you to sit up close and observe a turtle while painting it. This class is 
 best for ages 10 and up and cost $5. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
